# =============================================================================
# train.py
# Agri-Trust — YOLOv8 Training Script
#
# Features:
#   • Transfer learning from YOLOv8n pre-trained weights
#   • Absolute-path YAML patching (fixes Roboflow relative-path issue)
#   • Class distribution analysis + inverse-frequency weight logging
#   • Raspberry Pi Cam OV5647 simulation (via rpcam_augmentation.py)
#   • Early stopping (patience parameter)
#   • TensorBoard monitoring (auto-generated by Ultralytics)
#   • Post-training validation: mAP@50, mAP@50-95, PR curves, Confusion Matrix
#   • Per-class recall report highlighting food-safety critical classes
#
# Usage:
#   python train.py
#   python train.py --model yolov8s.pt --epochs 200 --batch 8
#   python train.py --resume python/runs/agritrust_v3/weights/last.pt
#
# Monitor training:
#   tensorboard --logdir python/runs
# =============================================================================

